%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as AXI4 Master
    participant C as Converter
    participant S as AXIL4 Slave
    Note over M,S: 4-beat burst (ARLEN=3), pipelining slave
    M->>C: AR (ARLEN=3)
    C->>S: AR[0]
    S-->>C: R[0]
    C->>S: AR[1]
    S-->>C: R[1]
    C->>S: AR[2]
    S-->>C: R[2]
    C->>S: AR[3]
    S-->>C: R[3]
    C-->>M: R x4 (RLAST on the 4th)
    Note over M,S: N issue cycles + one response latency,<br/>NOT N round trips. Serialization is between<br/>whole bursts only (the one-outstanding guard).
